    {
      "id": "auth-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "AUTHENTICATION FLOW\n\n1. Check CLI auth state\n2. Get room token from OAuth server\n3. Connect WebSocket to traffic controller\n4. Send authenticate message with JWT\n5. Join repository room\n\nTokens expire after 1 hour (refresh needed)",
      "color": "#8B5CF6"
    },
    {
      "id": "lock-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "TURN-BASED LOCKING\n\nConflict-free collaboration:\n- Request exclusive lock\n- 5-minute auto-expiring locks\n- Cross-branch warnings\n- Locks released on branch switch\n\nServer enforces single owner per resource",
      "color": "#F59E0B"
    },
    {
      "id": "presence-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "PRESENCE SYSTEM\n\nReal-time collaboration awareness:\n- Global presence room subscription\n- Per-repository peer tracking\n- Status updates (online/away)\n- Open repository tracking\n\nUses Control Tower Core BaseClient",
      "color": "#10B981"
    },
    {
      "id": "arch-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "ARCHITECTURE\n\nRenderer Process:\n- GitSyncConnectionManager (singleton)\n- GitSyncClient (proxy to main)\n- GitSyncPanelContext (React state)\n\nMain Process:\n- GitSyncWebSocketManager (singleton)\n- Control Tower Core BaseClient\n- IPC bridge to renderers",
      "color": "#3B82F6"
    },
    {
