    {
      "id": "status-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "SHARED GIT STATUS\n\nReal-time git status sharing:\n- File watcher triggers on changes\n- 1 second debounce\n- Full file lists sent (not just counts)\n- Broadcast to all presence subscribers\n\nStatus includes:\n- Modified/staged/untracked files\n- Ahead/behind remote counts\n- Current branch",
      "color": "#EC4899"
    }
